566	     * {@link Dues#deferred}); a claim a statement binds is deferred only once the binding ends, staying in the
567	     * totals and settleable until then. A claim not OPEN, a date not after today, or a claim due by a date inside a closed
568	     * period is refused and nothing changes. Returns the person it belongs to.
