681	     * Split an amount (more than 0.00 and less than the claim's amount) off an OPEN claim. The claim keeps
682	     * the rest and is released from any figure a statement bound it to; a new OPEN claim of the same person
683	     * takes the amount split off, with the same date and note, unnumbered, opened by the user and
684	     * due by its date plus the terms then of its person's grade on its date, naming the claim it was split
685	     * from, carrying its tags, and a late entry when that claim is. It is judged by the claim split alone: a claim not OPEN, a deferred one, one due by a date inside a closed period, an amount out of range, or a
686	     * split by a role the sheet's permission matrix does not allow to open a claim is refused and nothing
687	     * changes. Returns the person it belongs to.
688	     */
