1066	    /**
1067	     * A steward moves a DRAFT, OPEN or PENDING claim to another person on the sheet. The claim keeps its
1068	     * date and takes the next number in the sequence it would be numbered in now (the sheet's, or its
1069	     * period's while period numbering is on), its old number never given again; a draft gets none. It is
1070	     * released from any figure a statement bound it to (live again until its new person's next statement), and lists as its new person's newest claim. A settled or voided claim, a
1071	     * correction, a claim due by a date inside a closed period or after the new person's retirement date, or a move
1072	     * by a role the sheet's permission matrix does not allow (a steward, unless set) is refused and nothing changes. Returns the people it moved from and to.
1073	     */
1074	    @Transactional
1075	    public long[] reassign(String sheetId, String user, long claimId, long toPersonId) {
1076	        return reassign(sheetId, user, claimId, toPersonId, false);
1077	    }
