    24	 * written for a day on or before it (every change made while its today was on or before that date, and none
    25	 * made later), or the sheet as it stands when the date is on or after its today; none written by then is an
    26	 * empty sheet. It is shown by putting it in the store in place of the sheet within a transaction that is
    27	 * always rolled back, with the date as the sheet's today, so every figure is read exactly as for the live
    28	 * sheet and nothing of it is kept, announced or audited.
