    19	 * The holidays on a sheet, earliest first; no date is on it twice. A claim's due-by, when it is fixed as the
    20	 * claim is added, is the terms-th business day after its date, skipping weekends and the holidays on the sheet
    21	 * then (see {@link #dueBy}). A holiday added later fixes again the due-by of every claim on the sheet that is
    22	 * not SETTLED or VOID and is due on or after it, from the claim's date with the terms it was fixed with; a
    23	 * due-by a steward set directly stays as set.
    24	 */
